text = "PRESENT
Currently living in Pampanga of Philippines since August 10th of 2025 with my mother’s younger sister and her business driver. Facebook Marketplace listings of some devices that I barely use now since moving here from my rented apartment. Posting gaming/tech content online to Facebook and YouTube while looking out for Cashbacks/Promos from legal registered platforms like PDAX (Philippines Digital Assets Exchange) or my previous involvement with the Local Crypto/Web3 Community. Accepting requests for laptop/cellphone repairs from aunt’s friends or acquaintances here. First time doing thermal paste replacement on a computer’s dedicated graphics card earlier today: youtu.be/zFa8XLHAn0c
PDAX Promos: facebook.com/share/p/18AftaaiBg/
Facebook Marketplace Profile: facebook.com/marketplace/profile/100055752107854/

Birth Certificate (DOB: July 24, 1992)
Philippine Driver’s License (Expired since 2022)
Philippine Passport (Valid until August 27, 2028)
NBI Clearance

Taking maintenance medication since 2005 after first diagnosis in Al Khobar, Saudi Arabia. Granted there were times where I would skip doses and suffer the consequence of that. Been doing my best to manage without spending much on the medicines. I never went through applying for PWD ID.

Feb. 14, 2026
Deliverables were a cellphone that I handled SIM card registration for a minor as requested by that minor’s father. Created Google/Gmail with Parental Controls connected to the father’s Google Account. Mobile Legends game installed as requested and a Facebook account. This device is a gift to his son.

Dec. 1, 2025
First time rehousing of a cellphone’s components to solve the LCD issue as buying the housing or frame with the LCD was cheaper on the online shopping platform I use compared to just the LCD. Reference: facebook.com/share/r/16mVpAsLxZ/

Nov. 10-19, 2025
Laptop (HP Pavilion dv6-2102TX) fixed with battery pack replacement. Extracted installed 64-bit Windows 7 Professional’s License key and included it in the deliverable via repair log. Upgraded to Windows 10 with Microsoft Office 2016. Advised to replace CMOS battery. Client was aunt’s friend.

Oct. 22-Nov. 6, 2025
Laptop (Acer Aspire 4739) needed charging adapter cable replacement then battery pack replacement. BIOS Admin Password present, used Windows 7’s vulnerability to install EasyBCD in order to be able to boot into the Windows Installer Pen Drive and install Windows 10. Later on, found the laptop’s original BIOS Firmware online and flashed it to remove the BIOS Password. Client was aunt’s business acquaintance. Reference: facebook.com/share/v/1CUn23sHsU/

Sept. 15, 2025 – Local AI/LLM on GTX1070
Started experimenting with running LLM and Video Generation AI on my personal Desktop PC.
Reference: facebook.com/share/v/1ByrMqz9qs/

Aug. 9, 2025 – Moved to Pampanga
Had to move residence because the previous apartment needed after-repairs, specifically leaking during heavy rains. The house in Pampanga where my aunt does her Dry Goods or Clothing Store business in with her supposedly son’s wife’s cousin in Floridablanca. Her 2 offsprings used to live here too. Soon after moving I bought and set-up IPCameras for our house and helped a neighbor set-up theirs.
Reference: facebook.com/share/v/1GY5xrhWQh/
IPCAM & Internet Router Setup: facebook.com/share/p/17uxZpM5vN/

