GAP (Guild Advancement Program) Season 4: I didn’t use or make a tracker.
GAP S5: I can’t remember if I participated but the tracker isn’t there in my Google Sheets, most likely because GensoKishi which I was heavily playing that time wasn’t part of this season.
GAP S6: Point where I still play GensoKishi but started exploring YGG. docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hIhSxk6JvT2T9zPobZlpL014AGamFoQwO3w1xZ_5ci8/
