Returned to Philippines and lived in R. Valle 2nd St. with my younger sister first with Uncles then a maid. (Continued H.S. at Siena, met new friends there. Got blacklisted from their Highschool so coninued 4th Year as Homeschooling at a HS in Antipolo until I decided I wanted to continue pursuing my childhood dream of learning how to make what I see on the computer/Programming)

